    @section sshtypedcontractindex Typed Contract Index

    This page summarizes all public typed hashes used by the ssh binary module
    and its qlib helper modules.

    @subsection sshtypedcontractindexbinary Binary-Module Typed Hashes

    The following tables list the typed hashes declared in the
    @ref Qore::Ssh "Qore::Ssh" namespace, grouped by functional domain.

    <b>Server Configuration</b>

    <table>
    <tr><th>Symbol</th><th>Description</th></tr>
    <tr><td>@ref Qore::Ssh::SshServerConfig "SshServerConfig"</td><td>top-level server configuration with listeners, callbacks, and providers</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@ref Qore::Ssh::SshListenerConfig "SshListenerConfig"</td><td>per-listener bind, auth, security, and keepalive configuration</td></tr>
    </table>

    <b>Server Status</b>

    <table>
    <tr><th>Symbol</th><th>Description</th></tr>
    <tr><td>@ref Qore::Ssh::SshServerStatus "SshServerStatus"</td><td>server runtime status with per-listener detail</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@ref Qore::Ssh::SshListenerStatus "SshListenerStatus"</td><td>individual listener runtime status</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@ref Qore::Ssh::SshActiveSessionInfo "SshActiveSessionInfo"</td><td>active session info with byte counters and SFTP operation count</td></tr>
    </table>

    <b>Session and Authentication</b>

    <table>
    <tr><th>Symbol</th><th>Description</th></tr>
    <tr><td>@ref Qore::Ssh::SshSessionInfo "SshSessionInfo"</td><td>SSH session metadata including identity, address, and policy</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@ref Qore::Ssh::SshAuthContextInfo "SshAuthContextInfo"</td><td>authentication context with method, credentials, and metadata</td></tr>
    <tr><td>@ref Qore::Ssh::SshAuthDecision "SshAuthDecision"</td><td>authentication decision with principal, policy, and partial-auth support</td></tr>
    </table>

